        "text": "The first couple of days after we launched the project we were just refreshing the stats. When you refresh it's another 100 users join our project from all over the globe. I will never get tired of that feeling. It's very fulfilling organically. We have this idea shaped about gridding network to build an open layer on Solana for Edge Compute. Now we have around 1 million concurrent nodes running in the globe and we cover around 190 countries already aggregate. Our thesis is the demand for compute is only growing stronger and stronger as AI becomes more popular. We want to connect all the untapped compute resources into a single layer to serve the most innovative cutting edge use cases in the world. Solana community are very familiar with the term deeping and understand how to participate in it. When we make our announcement for our products I think the community naturally picks it up. Teams on Solana are very focusing on user experience. Working with those teams make our migration much easier than we expected. So we have a lot of help from them.",
